### ==============================================================================
### TASKFLOW CLOUD API GATEWAY (PORT 8080) TEST REQUESTS
### ==============================================================================

### 1. Actuator Health Check on Gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. View Active Routes in Gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/gateway/routes
Accept: application/json

### 3. Login via Gateway -> Routed to Identity Service (Port 8081)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alex.morgan@eztask.dev",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Try Creating Task via Gateway WITHOUT Token -> Should Return 401 Unauthorized
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "boardId": "board-default",
  "columnId": "col-todo",
  "title": "Test Unauthorized Access",
  "description": "Should fail at Gateway level",
  "priority": "LOW"
}

### 5. Get Default Board via Gateway (Kanban Columns)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/boards/default
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 6. Create Task via Gateway WITH Token -> Routed to Task Service (Port 8082)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "boardId": "board-default",
  "columnId": "col-todo",
  "title": "Unified Gateway Routed Task",
  "description": "Created via Port 8080 through Spring Cloud Gateway with Circuit Breaker",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

### 7. Get Tasks in Board via Gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/board/board-default
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 8. Direct Test Circuit Breaker Fallback Endpoint (Identity)
GET http://localhost:8080/fallback/identity

### 9. Direct Test Circuit Breaker Fallback Endpoint (Task)
GET http://localhost:8080/fallback/task

### 10. Direct Test Circuit Breaker Fallback Endpoint (Notification)
GET http://localhost:8080/fallback/notification
